---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="argument section" aria-labelledby="argument-h">
  <div class="container argument__grid">
    <div class="argument__body">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The argument</p>
      <h2 id="argument-h" class="argument__lead" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms">
        Capability is now cheap. Judgment is the constraint.
      </h2>
      <div class="argument__prose measure" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
        <p>
          For twenty years the scarce resource in any operating business was
          execution — people who could do the work. AI has collapsed the price
          of that work almost to zero. Drafting, modelling, analysis, support:
          the machine does it faster than a team ever could.
        </p>
        <p>
          What the machine cannot supply is judgment — knowing which number
          matters, which deal to walk from, where the unit economics actually
          break. That has become the rarest and most valuable thing a business
          can hold.
        </p>
        <p>
          So the design question is no longer how to automate people out. It is
          where to place them. The firms that compound put their sharpest
          humans in front of the machine, pointing it, not behind it, cleaning
          up after it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="argument__quote" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <hr class="rule-gold argument__quote-rule" />
      <blockquote>
        <p>{site.thesis}</p>
      </blockquote>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .argument__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .argument__lead {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .argument__prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .argument__quote {
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
  }
  .argument__quote-rule {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .argument__quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .argument__quote blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .argument__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .argument__quote {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
